<title>CHINA: China zinc exports up 129 pct in Jan-May.</title>
<headline>China zinc exports up 129 pct in Jan-May.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's exports of unwrought zinc and zinc alloys reached 198,386 tonnes in the first five months of 1997, a rise of 129.3 percent compared with the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>	 EXPORTS JAN-MAY	MAY	YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p> Zinc   198,386		36,241     +129.3</p>
<p>Note: Figures given in tonnes</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
</text>
